        <div class="process-row"><span>04</span><b>実装・制作</b><p><span class="word-development">開発</span><span class="word-connect">と</span><span class="word-expression">表現</span>を往復しながら完成へ</p><i>build</i></div>
        <div class="process-row"><span>05</span><b>検証・公開</b><p>動く・伝わる・繰り返せるを確認</p><i>release</i></div>
        <div class="process-row"><span>06</span><b>運用・改善</b><p>記録を残し、次に使える知識へ</p><i>continue</i></div>
      </div>
    </section>

